      "q": "How much does Federal Express make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Federal Express obligated $346M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Federal Express received 912 awards so far this fiscal year with an average award size of $379K, and obligations fell 40.5% year over year."
