    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Federal Express?",
      "a": "Department of Veterans Affairs and Department of Defense are the top buyers in FY2026 to date, obligating $193M and $135M respectively. Other buyers in FY2026 to date include the Department of Justice at $7.2M and smaller obligations from Departments of Transportation, Agriculture, Homeland Security, Commerce, NASA, Interior, and Health and Human Services."
    },
